<title>GERMANY: Buba's Hesse says liquidity expansion above target.</title>
<headline>Buba's Hesse says liquidity expansion above target.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Helmut Hesse said on Thursday that the German money supply had expanded faster than the Bundesbank had expected this year.</p>
<p>Speaking at a Hannover university, Hesse said, &quot;We have already injected more money into the economy than planned this year,&quot; Hesse said.</p>
<p>((--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525 ))</p>
</text>
